        "after_blob": "8083c3c6b899c3241bec8d09aeb82847685e3fbd",
        "hunk_review": "The sole hunk replaces the prior nonempty/skip-zero branch with activeItem.focus when present, otherwise setFirstItemActive. This solves modern grid retention but contradicts the classic first-enabled contract and can focus a disabled active item."
